            "unit_id": "db43e253bea18.u21.5903",
            "quote": "the advertisement, particularly the presentation of financial return relating to the services, should be prepared in a manner that is consistent with the principles"
          }
        ],
        "rationale": "The claim governs presentation of advertised service returns. It does not determine whether this particular component is caught by the selected gift restriction, even if both controls apply to the same promotion."
